 "releaseNotes": "Clean Up Similar Photos gets a major upgrade:\n\n• Newly added photos are processed incrementally—no full library rescan needed.\n• Browse and adjust groups while processing; progress and space estimates are saved automatically and can resume after interruptions.\n• Keep or delete entire groups, with fixes for selection and preview mismatches.\n• Faster large-library processing, an improved iPad layout, and better reliability with Limited Photos access.\n\nAll photo analysis remains completely on device to protect your privacy.",
